1
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:12,670
本WEB版外挂字幕由
风吹来的那片云 双语合并

2
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:12,670
{\an8}《匹兹堡医魂》 第二季第十五集

3
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:14,800
巴兰 这是你吗
Baran, is this you?

4
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:24,180
我五岁那年得了严重的
病毒性脑膜炎后就开始了
It began after a bad case
of viral meningitis when I was five.

5
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,520
他们尝试了所有抗癫痫药物
They tried every anti-seizure medication,

6
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:30,730
但我还是每隔几个月就会发作
but I still had episodes
every few months or so.

7
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:33,900
以前从没有人注意到
他们以为我只是在专注思考
No one's ever noticed before.
They just think I'm thoughtful.

8
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:37,490
你开车吗
Are you driving?

9
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:40,620
我开不了 直到12年前
I couldn't until laser ablation

10
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:43,370
做了左颞叶激光消融术
to my left temporal lobe 12 years ago.

11
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:46,620
那之后再加上开浦兰 我再没发作过
Between that and the Keppra,
I've been seizure-free,

12
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:49,880
精神科医生认为我可以开车
并担任主治医生
cleared by Neurology to drive
and to work as an attending.

13
00:00:52,250 --> 00:00:55,550
你今天的发作和你上一次发作之间
间隔了多久
How long, uh, between the seizure
you had today and the last one?

14
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:59,220
一年多
It's been well over a year.

15
00:01:01,970 --> 00:01:03,100
但我今天发作了两次
But I had two today.

16
00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:09,600
我不知道为什么
I don't know why.

17
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:13,190
可能是因为睡眠不足 新工作的压力 我…
It could be sleep deprivation, new job stress.

18
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:16,950
从阿富汗回来后
我就没接触过儿科病例了
I--I haven't had to deal
with Peds cases since Afghanistan.

19
00:01:17,450 --> 00:01:19,110
你现在有什么治疗方案
What are your options now?

20
00:01:21,450 --> 00:01:23,080
加大开浦兰药量
up my Keppra

21
00:01:23,080 --> 00:01:26,450
或者试试某种新型抗癫痫药
or maybe try one
of the newer anti-seizure meds.

22
00:01:26,450 --> 00:01:29,040
但如果不管用的话 我只有两个选择
But if that doesn't work,
I'm left with two choices

23
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:33,750
一个是颞叶切除术
但可能会影响我的语言功能
um, a temporal lobectomy,
which could impair my speech,

24
00:01:33,750 --> 00:01:36,210
另一个是植入神经调节装置
or get a neuromodulation device,

25
00:01:36,210 --> 00:01:39,800
可以感知到癫痫发作并立即阻止
which can sense and stop
the seizures almost immediately.

26
00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:41,640
你必须公开这件事
You need to disclose this.

27
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:43,220
我知道 我有计划
I know. I have a plan.

28
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:46,010
嘿 罗比 达娜找你 她在儿科
Hey, Robby, Dana's looking for you.
She's in Peds.

29
00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:47,310
好的 我马上过去
Yeah, OK, I'll be right there.

30
00:01:48,690 --> 00:01:51,440
看来儿科需要你 我也有病人要看
Sounds like you're needed in Peds,
and I have patients to see.

31
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:53,980
罗比 有一个严重头痛的孕妇
Robby, pregnant woman
with severe headache

32
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:55,730
被救护车送来的
on her way in by ambulance.

33
00:01:55,730 --> 00:01:57,610
找阿伯特或是夜班住院医生
Find Abbot or a night shift resident.

34
00:02:01,820 --> 00:02:03,620
{\an8}（第15小时）

35
00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:07,330
{\an8}（晚上9点至10点）

36
00:02:13,380 --> 00:02:15,210
我需要你清空口袋
Need you to turn out your pockets.

37
00:02:21,510 --> 00:02:22,970
好的 伸出双手
OK. Show me your hands.

38
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,000
经常来这儿吗
Come here often?

39
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:02,300
怎么了
What's going on?

40
00:03:03,340 --> 00:03:05,720
抱歉 虚惊一场 我们以为她发烧了
Oh, sorry--false alarm.
We thought she spiked a fever,

41
00:03:05,720 --> 00:03:08,350
结果是从那一堆纸质病历里拿错了
but it was the wrong chart
from our analog hell.

42
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:11,890
你认识愿意接受亲属领养的人吗
You know anybody
who might consider kinship adoption?

43
00:03:11,890 --> 00:03:15,020
- 医生和护士都符合要求 - 别看我
- Doctors and nurses qualify.
- Don't look at me.

44
00:03:15,020 --> 00:03:18,320
嘿 你能让你的人盯着点
阿尔-哈希米医生直到她离开吗
Hey, can your staff keep an eye
on Dr. Al-Hashimi until she leaves?

45
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:19,190
为什么
Why?

46
00:03:21,860 --> 00:03:24,780
因为她太累了 我不想看到她出错
Uh, because I think she's tired,
and I don't want her to make any mistakes.

47
00:03:24,780 --> 00:03:26,950
好建议 也许也适用于你
Oh, great advice. Maybe you should take it.

48
00:03:26,950 --> 00:03:28,780
是啊 我要出去呼吸下新鲜空气
Yeah. I'm gonna go get some fresh air.

49
00:03:28,790 --> 00:03:30,450
顺便把我的那份也吸了
Grab some for me while you're out there.

50
00:03:30,450 --> 00:03:32,200
你的肺会手足无措的
Your lungs wouldn't know what to do with it.

51
00:03:32,210 --> 00:03:34,580
- 去你的 - 在孩子面前爆粗口 你可真行
- Screw you! - In front of the baby? Nice.

52
00:03:37,670 --> 00:03:38,590
乖
Yeah.

53
00:03:39,170 --> 00:03:40,960
我们是夜行者
We are the night crawlers.

54
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:44,010
我们处理的是
最奇怪最狂野的病例 因为…
We deal with the weirdest
and the wildest because...

55
00:03:44,010 --> 00:03:46,550
我们是最奇怪最狂野的医生
We are the weirdest
and the wildest of them all.

56
00:03:46,550 --> 00:03:50,310
没错 今晚他们必然会满地乱爬
去拿下他们吧
That is right, and tonight, they are
really gonna be crawling. Now go get some!

57
00:03:55,810 --> 00:03:56,850
抱歉吵醒你了
Sorry to wake you.

58
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,820
我…我在思考呢
I--I was thinking.
